
# type(scope): summary in the imperative, 72 characters at most, no full stop
#
# Body (optional): why the change was needed and what it does, wrapped at 72.
# Say what a reader of the diff could not work out alone.
#
# Types
#   feat      something a visitor can now see or do
#   fix       a fix for behaviour that was wrong
#   perf      faster or lighter, same behaviour
#   refactor  restructuring with no behaviour change
#   test      tests or checks only
#   docs      documentation, templates, unlinked post drafts
#   build     Vite, ESLint, dependencies, Vercel config, scripts
#   chore     anything else that does not touch the shipped site
#
# Scopes (optional): home, work, blog, styles, deploy
#
# One logical change per commit. Each commit should pass
# npm run lint and npm run build on its own.
#
# Enable this template once per clone:  git config commit.template .gitmessage
